ebm?t=1761557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858150/extras/9e4317a9f5db13f1bbd4eea285c657df.mp4?t=1761557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Path Planning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where your fleet goes on its journey. Different destinations have pros and cons in terms of what enemies you fight, the rewards you get, the available upgrades, and your relationships with local factions. For example, you can befriend cultists, gaining their Worm Blessings and their aid in future battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858150/extras/c2195d0d4dc27ae1805ac4c7ec8d4800.poster.avif?t=1761557302\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858150/extras/c2195d0d4dc27ae1805ac4c7ec8d4800.webm?t=1761557302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858150/extras/c2195d0d4dc27ae1805ac4c7ec8d4800.mp4?t=1761557302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Panoply of Powerups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your ship with cannons, rockets, aerial torpedoes, mines, gatling guns, and more. Strengthen it with modules like ammo elevators, guard barracks, command posts. Host strange temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your ship with training for your crew, more armor plating, or senior officers. Pick a doctrine to gain its advantages: terrify your enemies, dodge incoming attacks, make your money through trade. Find powerful combinations that lay waste to your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img